              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo miryango, ukw ar’ ibiri n’igihimba, bamaze guhabga amashamvu yabo hakuno ya Yorodani aharābana n’i Yeriko, ku ruhande rw’i burasirazuba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.15",
